+      ['Acceptance criteria','- Given a basket and no account, when the shopper picks “Continue as guest” and pays, then the order is placed and a receipt reaches the email address within one minute.\n- Given a guest order that fails the fraud check, when the shopper pays, then no money is taken and the shopper sees why.'],
+      ['Out of scope','- Turning a guest into an account after the order — later, if the numbers ask for it.'],
+      ['Agent intent (ICE)','- Goal: A guest pays and gets a receipt by email within one minute.\n- Limit: A guest gives an email address and nothing else.\n- Fails if: a guest order skips the fraud check.\n- Checked by: an end-to-end test that buys as a guest and reads the email.'],
