+      ['Benefit hypothesis','As a returning shopper, we believe that seeing every order and its status [-under the account menu-]{+on the home page+} will cut “where is my order” calls. We will know it is true when those calls drop by a quarter.'],
+      ['Boundary (In / Out / Never)','- In: the list of past orders, each with its status and items.\n- Out: changing an order — Checkout and Refunds own that.\n- Never: show one shopper another shopper’s orders.'],
