+      ['Boundary (In / Out / Never)','- In: full and part refunds on a paid order, made by shop staff.\n- Out: taking payment — Checkout owns money coming in.\n- Never: send money to a card that did not pay for the order.\n- Never: let one person refund more than £500 alone.'],
